        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carla Lane, Paul McCartney, Norman Rossington\n- Works: Some Will, Some Won't, Get Well Soon, A Hard Day's Night\n- Roles: Carla Lane's father, Paul McCartney's grandfather\n- Topics: writers' real-life meeting\n\nFacts:\n- Norman Rossington played Carla Lane's father in the film \"Some Will, Some Won't\".\n- The TV series \"Get Well Soon\" depicted the real-life meeting of the writers of \"Some Will, Some Won't\".\n- Norman Rossington also played Paul McCartney's grandfather in the film \"A Hard Day's Night\".",
